  "body": "2 Bedroom Bach at Pinewoods Top 10 Holiday Park. Elevated and sunny with views from the balcony.  Recently renovated new toilet, shower and vanity. Freshly painted. Designed for easy living within a friendly community \r\n\r\n2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, open plan living/kitchen.  A Builders Report supplied on request.\r\n\r\nPinewoods has walking access to the beach as well as the Holiday Park facilities: adventure playground, table tennis, pétanque, flying fox, trampoline, bike track and lots of organised events. In the area, Orewa cafes and restaurants, Silverdale shopping,  \r\n\r\nNote:  you are not purchasing land but shares in the Pinewoods Top 10 Holiday Motor Camp, with the right to reside in the bach. For the first 24 months, baches may only be occupied for holiday use, from the start of Labour weekend to the end of Easter weekend, together with all weekends, school holidays and public holidays. Shareholders who have exceeded 24 months may then occupy their baches full time all year-round.\r\n\r\nLink to Pinewoods site - A Guide for Residents\" for more information.\r\nhttps://www.pinewoods.co.nz/files/67bb928ad5746bc3958d5ffb?disposition=inline",
